{"answerArea":{"calculator":false,"chi2Table":false,"periodicTable":false,"tTable":false,"zTable":false},"hints":[{"content":"$\\dfrac{\\ln(x)}{\\sin(x)}$ is the quotient of two, more basic, expressions: $\\ln(x)$ and $\\sin(x)$.\n\nTherefore, $\\dfrac{dy}{dx}$ can be found using **the quotient rule**:\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\left[\\dfrac{u(x)}{v(x)}\\right]\u0026=\\dfrac{\\dfrac{d}{dx}[u(x)]v(x)-u(x)\\dfrac{d}{dx}[v(x)]}{[v(x)]^2}\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\dfrac{u'(x)v(x)-u(x)v'(x)}{[v(x)]^2}\n\\end{align}$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"Let's differentiate!\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}\\dfrac{dy}{dx}\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\left(\\dfrac{\\ln(x)}{\\sin(x)}\\right)\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\dfrac{\\dfrac{d}{dx}(\\ln(x))\\sin(x)-\\ln(x)\\dfrac{d}{dx}(\\sin(x))}{(\\sin(x))^2}\u0026\u0026\\gray{\\text{The quotient rule}}\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\dfrac{\\dfrac1x\\cdot \\sin(x)-\\ln(x)\\cdot \\cos(x)}{(\\sin(x))^2}\u0026\u0026\\gray{\\text{Differentiate }\\ln(x)\\text{ and }\\sin(x)}\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\dfrac{\\sin(x)-x\\ln(x)\\cos(x)}{x\\sin^2(x)}\u0026\u0026\\gray{\\text{Simplify}}\n\\end{align}$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"In conclusion,\n\n$\\dfrac{dy}{dx}=\\dfrac{\\sin(x)-x\\ln(x)\\cos(x)}{x\\sin^2(x)}$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"Let $y=\\dfrac{\\ln(x)}{\\sin(x)}$.\n\n**Find $\\dfrac{dy}{dx}$.**\n\n[[☃ radio 1]]\n","images":{},"widgets":{"radio 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"choices":[{"content":"$\\dfrac{\\sin(x)-x\\ln(x)\\cos(x)}{x\\sin^2(x)}$","correct":true},{"content":"$\\dfrac{1-x\\cos(x)}{x\\sin(x)}$","correct":false},{"content":"$\\dfrac{1}{x\\sin(x)}$","correct":false,"isNoneOfTheAbove":false},{"content":"$\\dfrac{\\cos(x)+x\\sin(x)\\ln(x)}{x\\sin(x)}$","correct":false,"isNoneOfTheAbove":false}],"countChoices":false,"deselectEnabled":false,"displayCount":null,"hasNoneOfTheAbove":false,"multipleSelect":false,"randomize":true},"static":false,"type":"radio","version":{"major":1,"minor":0}}}}}
